==Trivia==
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], this stage is called '''Baroton'''.
*Broton makes a few references to the ''[[wikipedia:Transformers|Transformers]]'' franchise:
**Its Japanese name, Planet Choibatron, sounds similar to [https://tfwiki.net/wiki/Cybertron_(planet) Cybertron], the Transformers' home planet, which it vaguely resembles.
**The yellow car on its base is reminiscent of [[wikipedia:Bumblebee (Transformers)|Bumblebee]], one of the franchise's major characters.
**Its [[Treasure]] in the Korean version is quite literally Transformers.
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|version 11.5]], the Mesocosmocyclones in Chapter 3 were set to spawn 66.7~33.3 seconds apart instead of just 66.7. It didn't work properly because the maximum time was lower than the minimum, so in practice nothing changed.

